<title>LATVIA: BUDGET SURPLUS SO FAR THIS YEAR 2.47 MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>BUDGET SURPLUS SO FAR THIS YEAR 2.47 MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia was running a budget surplus of 2.465 million lats according to latest data, the finance ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that total revenue was 114.364 million lats and expenditure was 111.899 million lats.</p>
<p>Total internal state debt was 193.636 million lats, made up mostly of government T-bills at 124.717 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
